# Deliberately excluded from the default v0.1 image.
# Add only after redistribution terms, resource use, and package source are approved.
# onlyoffice-desktopeditors
# TurboWarp Desktop (no Debian package; packaging decision required)
# Kolibri content channels (distributed as separate content packs)

# Excluded on purpose, not merely pending review:
# ttf-mscorefonts-installer - requires EULA acceptance and a SourceForge
#   download during a non-interactive chroot install, which breaks the build
#   and contradicts offline-first delivery. Use fonts-liberation instead.
# libdvdcss2 - DVD playback is not a school requirement.
# tlp - conflicts with the KDE powerdevil power management already shipped.
# zram-tools - replaces swap wholesale; needs memory qualification first.
# clamav / clamav-daemon - 18 MB of library plus a daemon that cannot
#   function without downloaded signature databases, which an offline image
#   cannot carry. Previously shipped disabled and masked, which implied
#   protection that did not exist. Available from the online path on request.
# seahorse - the archive keyring ships pre-trusted via Signed-By, so users
#   have no key to import by hand.